Package: synapse
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, openssl
Recommends: clamav-daemon, redis-server
Description: High-performance reverse proxy and firewall
 Synapse is a high-performance reverse proxy and firewall built with Rust,
 featuring XDP-based packet filtering, dynamic access rules, threat intelligence
 integration, and advanced routing capabilities. It provides ultra-low latency
 protection at the kernel level and can operate in reverse proxy mode or
 firewall-only mode.
